eadquarters in New York City on September 22, 2026. President Donald Trump rejected international efforts to regulate artificial intelligence during a speech to the United Nations General Assembly on Tuesday. \"The United States ... totally rejects any attempt to construct a globalist scheme to control for the artificial intelligence being spoken of so much now,\" he said. In the address, Trump instead referred to AI as \"super intelligence,\" arguing that the term artificial \"makes it sound fake, and it is not fake. In his address on Tuesday, Trump rejected the notion, saying whoever masters the technology first wins."}, {"diagnostic_version": "strategic-actor-admission-diagnostics-v1", "event_id": "EVENT-3034B5E6CAA77B5590C0A9BC", "source_id": "SOURCE-3E5456157F539C59C224FDD7", "admission_status": "considered", "admission_reasons": [], "resolved_primary_actor": "Liquid AI Inc.", "entity_mentions_state": "present", "raw_actor_fields": {"primary_actor": null, "acting_entity": null, "actor": null, "organization": null, "organisation": null, "company": null, "institution": null, "regulator": null}, "raw_entity_mentions": [{"mention": "Liquid AI Inc.", "entity_type": "organization", "role": "actor", "raw_keys": ["context", "entity_type", "mention", "role", "sentence_id", "source_span", "type_source"]}], "event_keys": ["claim_status", "created_at", "entity_mentions", "event_dates_version", "event_end_at", "event_id", "event_start_at", "event_time_text", "event_type", "extraction_metadata", "published_at", "quantitative_claims", "relationship_mentions", "snippets", "source_id", "strategic_admission_reasons", "strategic_admission_status", "strategic_cluster_check", "strategic_cluster_development", "strategic_cluster_id", "strategic_cluster_label", "strategic_cluster_status", "strategic_cluster_terms", "strategic_dependency_tags", "strategic_event_class", "strategic_geography", "strategic_materiality_score", "strategic_mechanism_tags", "strategic_relation_signature", "str